#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:0
msgid ""
"Fix common Orca screen reader issues on Ubuntu Desktop, such as keyboard "
"layout mismatches and applications that start before Orca."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:7
msgid "Topics: Accessibility"
msgstr "話題：無障礙功能"

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:11
msgid "Improve screen reader usability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:13
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Desktop might present some challenges when using the screen reader. "
"If you experience difficulty, the following tips can help enhance the screen "
"reader experience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:16
msgid ""
"Many accessibility issues have been resolved with Ubuntu 26.04 LTS. If "
"you're using Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, switch to the earlier version of this guide "
"for additional tips."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:19
msgid "Try different keyboard layouts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:21
msgid ""
"If you use a mix of various user interface languages and localized keyboard "
"layouts, the screen reader might be using a different keyboard layout for "
"its commands than your active layout. For example, you might be using the "
"French layout but the screen reader commands treat your keyboard as if it "
"had the American English layout."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:23
msgid ""
"If screen reader commands don't work, try pressing the key as if another "
"relevant layout was active."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:25
msgid "Enable Orca before running applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/troubleshoot/improve-screen-reader-usability.md:27
msgid ""
"This issue affects Firefox and Chromium-based browsers in particular but can "
"occur with other applications. If Orca is enabled and works in your desktop "
"environment but does not work properly in the application, for example, it "
"does not read web pages in your browser, try closing the application and "
"restarting Orca *before* launching the application again."
msgstr ""
